'''Vice Admiral Rampart's office''' was the private office assigned to [[Vice Admiral]] [[Edmon Rampart]] inside the [[Imperial Inspectorate HQ|Naval Intelligence Headquarters]] on the [[planet]] [[Coruscant]].<ref name="Solitary Clone" /> Between [[19 BBY]] and [[18 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{TBBDate|203}}</ref> he called [[genetically defective clone]] [[Crosshair|CT-9904]] "Crosshair" to his office to assign him to [[Crosshair and Cody's team|CC-2224's squad]] for a [[Mission to Desix|sensitive mission]] to extract the [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[governor]] that was sent to claim the planet [[Desix]] and was being held hostage by the [[Desix Separatist holdout|local]] [[Separatist holdouts]]s. Upon the successful completion of the mission, Rampart called Crosshair back the later to assign him to [[CC-1226]] for his next mission.<ref name="Solitary Clone" />

==Behind the scenes==
The office made its first appearance in "[[The Solitary Clone]]," the third episode of the [[The Bad Batch Season 2|second season]] of ''[[Star Wars: The Bad Batch]]'', which was released on [[December 11]], [[2023]].<ref name="Solitary Clone" />

